===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|κένωσις||emptying}} (see [[keno-]] and [[κενό]]), from {{m|grc|κενόειν||to empty}} (with reference to Philippians 2.vii, "But he emptied himself, taking the form of a slave, becoming as human beings are" – New Jerusalem Version).

